cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Legal Case Validator"
abstract: >-
  A neurosymbolic document validator built with the cognition library. It reads the facts and court
  notes of an immigration case and decides whether the applicant qualifies for Special Immigrant
  Juvenile (SIJ) status under INA § 101(a)(27)(J).
